            <ArticleTitle>Effect of atorvastatin 15 mg/week on serum lipids in patients with hypercholesterolemia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>341-2, A9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Atorvastatin 15 mg/week was administered to 21 patients with hypercholesterolemia for 2 months. The mean low-density lipoprotein concentration decreased by 20% after treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
